{"4511850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Great Beyond", "steam_appid": 4511850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig! Defend! Develop!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make in this RTS game are critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build utilities, worker amenities, living quarters, and production factories to keep your economy flowing. Then, prepare for the onslaught of enemies by building towers, hiring and training Battle Engineers, and managing your energy and ammo reserves. But, not all missions are the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are a variety of mission types!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the galaxy from a mysterious virus found on an asteroid, and stop the spread!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bandits of aliens destroying local settlements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete special research projects by gathering samples and completing tasks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a profitable mining site!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuel rundown ships!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and retrieve artifacts deep underground!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repopulate a planet destroyed by volcanos!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might recognise me as Borrego6165 - my old account related to the game studio LVGameDev. I helped them on games such as SimAirport and SimCasino! This is a solo project unrelated to that studio. I have lots of experience with tycoon/simulation games, and wanted to add a survival twist!</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig! Defend! Develop!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The choices you make in this RTS game are critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build utilities, worker amenities, living quarters, and production factories to keep your economy flowing. Then, prepare for the onslaught of enemies by building towers, hiring and training Battle Engineers, and managing your energy and ammo reserves. But, not all missions are the same!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >There are a variety of mission types!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Protect the galaxy from a mysterious virus found on an asteroid, and stop the spread!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bandits of aliens destroying local settlements!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete special research projects by gathering samples and completing tasks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a profitable mining site!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuel rundown ships!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and retrieve artifacts deep underground!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Repopulate a planet destroyed by volcanos!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Developer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might recognise me as Borrego6165 - my old account related to the game studio LVGameDev. I helped them on games such as SimAirport and SimCasino! This is a solo project unrelated to that studio. I have lots of experience with tycoon/simulation games, and wanted to add a survival twist!</p>", "short_description": "Defeat the onslaught of aliens by building your own moon base, placing &amp; upgrading tower defences, managing units, and mining resources!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511850/811cc71e53eb7038f588d1d9869f79a4605c86cb/header.jpg?t=1781956256", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511850/59a9714c0c69adb4991a65dc729b99d783270642/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1781956256", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4511850/59a9714c0c69adb4991a65dc729b99d783270642/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1781956256", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"mi